## Draft handoff scope

Child of1575. Provisional receiving disposition; a fresh lead must finish
the four premise checks and full exit criteria before implementation.

Provide an explicit auxiliary CSV/README contract for produced estimates with no authoritative printed numeric comparator, separate from out/reproduce.csv comparison statuses and score denominators. Retain full precision, producer/specification/source-route/scope provenance. Lack of comparator is not missing input or failed execution; unprinted observations are not invented matches. Do not decide whether published qualitative/footnote outputs belong to canonical inventory, or authorize new robustness specs. No canonical schema/status/CRA/tolerance/comparison convention change; B3/B6/B7 remain held.

## Validation boundary

Documentation/source verification and semantic/preservation checks, not numerical reruns or wording tests. No paid API model calls. Keep all existing scoring, signing and held author decisions unchanged.
